        "Once every 1d4 rounds, a skull eater can bite extremely hard upon a single target that bypasses armor. The skull eater must make a touch attack (+19), if it hits, 14d6 points of non-elemental damage and must make a Fortitude save (DC 18) or be inflicted with the Poison status for 1d6 rounds. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 6th level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 27).",
